Description: Statistical analysis, reporting and visualization functions
    developed by the Biomedical Data Intelligence Unit (BIDU, formerly the
    Statistics and Bioinformatics Unit, UEB) of the Vall d'Hebron Research
    Institute (VHIR). The package provides tools for descriptive
    statistics, regression modelling, survival analysis, epidemiological
    studies, biomarker evaluation (ROC analysis), data management,
    graphical visualization and reporting in R Markdown.
